---
import ArrowRight from './icons/ArrowRight.astro';
---
<section class="cta" id="install" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
  <div class="aurora" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="aurora__beam"></div>
    <div class="aurora__beam"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content: center;">Get started</span>
    <h2 id="cta-title">Build it in two commands.<br />Run a sweep in five.</h2>
    <p>
      CMake configures the host, the Metal kernels, the tests, and the bench harness in one pass.
      The smoke script asserts both modes. The KATs run on every commit.
    </p>

    <div class="cta__actions">
      <a
        class="btn btn--accent btn--lg"
        href="https://github.com/sachncs/greedy-find#quick-start"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        Read the quick start <ArrowRight class="icon icon--sm" />
      </a>
      <a
        class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg"
        href="https://github.com/sachncs/greedy-find/blob/main/docs/algorithms.md"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        Algorithm deep dive
      </a>
    </div>

    <div
      style="
        margin-top: var(--space-7);
        padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--bg-elevated);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: var(--fs-sm);
        color: var(--text-muted);
        text-align: left;
        max-width: 640px;
        margin-inline: auto;
        line-height: 1.9;
      "
    >
      <span style="color: var(--text-faint);"># build</span><br />
      <span style="color: var(--text);">cmake -S . -B build</span><br />
      <span style="color: var(--text);">cmake --build build -j</span><br />
      <span style="color: var(--text-faint);"># smoke test (both modes)</span><br />
      <span style="color: var(--text);">bash examples/run.sh</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>